Get the value of an output instport belonging to the combinational UDP cell.
For an output instport belonging to the combinational UDP cell, if the input string values
are valid, the NPI Netlist API npi_nl_table_lookup returns a string representing the output
value specified in the UDP table. Otherwise, NULL is returned. Note that the returned
string is saved in a temporary buffer for subsequent use. If the string is to be used after a
subsequent call, the string should be copied to another location.

